{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. The layout features a suitcase positioned on the left side of the scene. For every sock in the image, there is a shirt located to its left, a remote aligned vertically with the shirt, and a pen located on the bottom side to the left of the suitcase. The sock is aligned vertically with the suitcase.",
